   - SCALED_RADIUS_OF_GYRATION: Combines variances; offers global shape compactness. (Moderate relevance)

#### 5. Higher-Order Moments:
   - SKEWNESS_ABOUT_MAJOR_AXIS: Indicates shape asymmetry along the major axis; distinguishes uneven silhouettes. (Moderate relevance)
